    "reviews": "\u201cTricky Towers thrives with local multiplayer\u201d<br>8/10 \u2013 The Guardian<br><br>\u201cA blend of physics-based tetris and magic in a sweet little package makes this a must have for gamers of all ages and sizes.\u201d<br>9.5/10 \u2013 GameGrin<br><br>\u201cEach game mode is genuinely enjoyable, and having modes that require different speeds of play and forms of strategy is an excellent way to keep players coming back for more\u201d<br>8/10 \u2013 GameSpew<br>",
